			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Sync Cocoon submodule to latest commit\n\nUpdate the Cocoon submodule (extension host sidecar) from cbaf44f1 to 6ac5b208.\n\nThis routine sync brings in the latest changes from the extension host implementation, which interfaces with Mountain via gRPC to run VS Code extensions through the Effect-TS service layer.",
